# Short-link routing for shareable puzzle URLs.
#
# The Worker's create response returns short paths like "/c/abc12". These
# rules 302 the browser to the hash-based play page so play.js can pick up
# the id from the URL fragment. Cloudflare Pages preserves the fragment in
# the Location header.
#
# The trailing "!" (force) is deliberately omitted — if a real file ever
# exists at these paths (it shouldn't), it wins over the redirect.

/c/:id  /play.html#c/:id  302
/s/:id  /play.html#s/:id  302
